# --- Mock interview app (interview_app/) ---
# Per-user gamification state and saved transcripts stay OUT of git:
coach/interview_history/
# But the question bank and hand-authored seed banks ARE committed. These
# overrides must come after the broad `data/` and `*.json` rules above.
!interview_app/data/
!interview_app/data/*.json

# --- Third-party saved reference pages (copyrighted; never publish) ---
# Wholesale saved copies of "ML System Design in a Hurry" (© Optick Labs) plus
# the extraction notes. Kept locally as reference, excluded from git/Pages.
ML Design/examples/
ML Design/EXTRACTION-SUMMARY.txt
# --- V9 coverage gate advisory sidecars (generated per compile; not source) ---
sessions/**/_coverage.md

# --- Lesson A/B scratch trees (never publish) ---
# _coldgen/ = cold-generation trials, _compare/ = gold-vs-engine pairs. Both hold
# duplicate copies of shipped lessons whose neighbour links point at days that do
# not exist in the scratch tree, so nav_audit reports them as broken. `.nojekyll`
# at the repo root means underscore-prefixed directories WOULD be served if they
# were ever committed, so keep them out of git entirely.
sessions/_coldgen/
sessions/_compare/

# agent scratch surfaces
.lavish/
.superpowers/
